> Inspect the native graph

The preview groups actual native graph endpoints into named stages, using independent source-sized parameters. It shows one recurrent transition; the complete training program retains the original full sequence unroll. Cache/filter/generation loops and CRF decoding remain explicit in the program below.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/character_rnn_lm_network.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
